        ],
        "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
            {
                "@value": "A top concept or entry point for a void:Dataset that is structured in a tree-like fashion. All resources in a dataset can be reached by following links from its root resources in a small number of steps."
